@startuml
left to right direction
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

actor Editor
actor Player
actor ProductOwner

Editor --> (Create Map)
Editor --> (Add Industry)
Editor --> (Add City)
Editor --> (Create Scenario)

(Create Map) --> (Define Map Size)
(Create Map) --> (Set Map Name)
(Add Industry) --> (Specify Position XY)
(Add City) --> (Indicate Coordinates XY)
(Add City) --> (Set City Name)
(Add City) --> (Define House Blocks)
(Set City Name) --> (No Special Characters/Digits)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Must be Positive)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Manually or automatically around the city)

Player --> (Build Station)
Player --> (Upgrade Station)
Player --> (View Station Details)
Player --> (Build Railway Line)
Player --> (Buy Train)
Player --> (Assign Train to Route)
Player --> (List Trains)

(Build Station) --> (Check Overbuilding)
(Build Railway Line) --> (Select Registered Stations)
(Buy Train) --> (Select Locomotive from List)
(Assign Train to Route) --> (Choose Valid Stations)
(List Trains) --> (Group by Locomotive Type)
(List Trains) --> (Sort Alphabetically)

ProductOwner --> (Cargo Generation Simulator)
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Generate Cargo at Stations)
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Consider Cities and Industries)
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Provide Start/Pause Option)


@enduml
